# my_engine: every key once on the kick track; each hit must sound and end by itself (drums are one-shots).
tempo 240
steps 96
tail 1.0
track kick
preset 128 30 0 0 40 90 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 F3 1 120
note 4 Gb3 1 120
note 8 G3 1 120
note 12 Ab3 1 120
note 16 A3 1 120
note 20 Bb3 1 120
note 24 B3 1 120
note 28 C4 1 120
note 32 Db4 1 120
note 36 D4 1 120
note 40 Eb4 1 120
note 44 E4 1 120
note 48 F4 1 120
note 52 Gb4 1 120
note 56 G4 1 120
note 60 Ab4 1 120
note 64 A4 1 120
note 68 Bb4 1 120
note 72 B4 1 120
note 76 C5 1 120
note 80 Db5 1 120
note 84 D5 1 120
note 88 Eb5 1 120
note 92 E5 1 120
expect sound 0 96
expect idle 106
expect peak_below -6       # -12 dBFS per hit; two voices can ring together
